  "prefLabel": "Plc 1001.03 Incorporated Definitions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1001.03 Incorporated Definitions.\n\n(a) The definitions in Plc 100 shall apply to this chapter.\n\n(b) Any term or acronym used in Plc 1002 shall have the meaning established in the rules that establish the license to which the rule pertains.\n\nSource. #13264, INTERIM, eff 9-22-21; ss by #13336, eff 1-27-22",
